== WHAT MUTATION C FOUND, AND IT IS A SECOND BLIND LIGHT OF THE SAME FAMILY
==
== With the escrow funding door refusing NOTHING, four probes still read PASS:
== P-2 (escrow_first), P-3a (pot), P-3b (transfer) and P-9.
==
== The reason is the same one that let P-2 (withdrawal_first) pass over a
== broken door this morning, seen from the other side. In P-3a and P-3b the
== ESCROW GOES FIRST. It wins the balance legitimately, and the leg that then
== has to be refused is the POT or the TRANSFER, whose own spendable check is
== untouched. "Exactly one of them took the naira" is satisfied by the other
== path doing all of the refusing.
==
== So P-3's reverse orderings are not merely a direction that has never run.
== THEY ARE THE ONLY DIRECTION OF P-3 IN WHICH THE ESCROW DOOR'S OWN REFUSAL
== IS TESTED AT ALL, and this run is the demonstration of it rather than an
== argument for it.
==
== P-9 passes under mutation C because every funding in P-9 is affordable, so
== the removed refusal is never asked a question. That is correct and is not
== a defect in P-9: P-9 is the float identity, not the overdraft gate.


