=============== MUTATION F (no transition legal) ===============
== SMOKE: one uncontested proposal and one uncontested funding call, before any probe runs
== RESULT: FAIL, AND THE HARNESS IS THE SUSPECT, NOT THE PRODUCT.

== WHAT MUTATION F SETTLES, AND IT CHANGED THE HARNESS. A guard that refuses
== every transition cannot get an agreement from INITIATED to HELD, so the
== SMOKE CHECK stops the run before P-8b is ever reached. That is the right
== order of events. But the smoke check's own wording said "THE HARNESS IS
== THE SUSPECT, NOT THE PRODUCT", and under mutation F the product was
== exactly the thing at fault. A gate that names a culprit it has not
== identified is the same error as a probe that claims a verdict it did not
== take, so the wording now says the harness is the FIRST suspect and names
== the other possibility. Nothing about what stops the run changed.

=============== MUTATION G (one legal pair swapped) ===============
