   P8-TABLE-DIFF FUNDED -> CANCELLED
   P8-TABLE-DIFF REFUNDED -> RELEASED
   P8-COUNTS pairs=72 legal=14 illegal=58 legal_allowed=14 illegal_refused=58 wrong=0
   P-8a (REFUNDED to RELEASED) FAIL An illegal transition was not refused by the trigger.
   P-8b (the whole table) FAIL counts=[P8-COUNTS pairs=72 legal=14 illegal=58 legal_allowed=14 illegal_refused=58 wrong=0] table=[P8-TABLE disagreements=2] wrong_rows=0. The shipped transition table disagreed with the probe's own copy, or a pair behaved against it. Read the P8-TABLE-DIFF and P8-WRONG lines above.
